{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Happy the [Am]home [G]when [Am]God [D]is [G]there,
[D7]And [G]love [D]fills [G]ev[A7]ery [D]breast;
[Am]When one [E7]their [Am]wish, [A7]and [D]one [A7]their [D]praye[D7]r,
[G]And [C]one their [G]heaven[D7]ly [G]rest.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Happy [Am]the [G]home [Am]where [D]Jesus' [G]name
[D7][G]is [D]sweet [G]to [A7]every [D]ear;
[Am][E7]where [Am]children [A7]early [D][A7]speak [D]his [D7]fame,
[G]and [C]parents [G]hold [D7]him [G]dear.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Happy [Am]the [G]home [Am]where [D]prayer [G]is heard,
[D7]and [G]praise [D]is [G]wont [A7]to [D]rise;
[Am][E7]where [Am]parents [A7]love [D][A7]the [D]sacred [D7]Word
[G]and [C]all [G]its [D7]wisdom [G]prize.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Lord, [Am]let [G]us [Am]in [D]our [G]homes agree
[D7][G]this [D]blessed [G]peace [A7]to [D]gain;
[Am][E7]unite [Am]our [A7]hearts [D]in [A7]love [D]to [D7]thee,
[G]and [C]love [G]to [D7]all [G]will reign.
